# Privacy Policy for ParkVision

**Last Updated:** March 16, 2026

## Overview

ParkVision ("the App") is a 3D sliding-block puzzle game developed by Meshy. We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about how we handle your data.

## Data Collection

ParkVision does **not** collect, store, or transmit any user data to our servers. We have no servers, no databases, and no access to your information.

### We Do NOT Collect
- Personal identification information
- Location data
- Usage analytics or tracking
- Advertising identifiers
- Any data whatsoever

## Data Storage

All your data remains entirely under your control:
1. **Locally** on your device
2. **In your private iCloud account** (if iCloud is enabled)

Game progress — including level completions, star ratings, move counts, and settings — is stored using Apple's on-device storage (UserDefaults and SwiftData). If iCloud is enabled, this data syncs privately through your own iCloud account.

We have **zero access** to your data. Apple's iCloud infrastructure ensures your data remains private and encrypted.

## In-App Purchases

ParkVision offers optional in-app purchases (Solution Credits) through Apple's StoreKit. All payment processing is handled entirely by Apple. We do not receive, store, or have access to any payment information. Apple's privacy policy applies: [apple.com/privacy](https://www.apple.com/privacy/)

## Third-Party Services

ParkVision does **not** integrate any third-party SDKs, analytics, advertising frameworks, or tracking services. The App uses only Apple first-party frameworks.

### iCloud
If enabled, your data syncs via Apple's iCloud. Apple's privacy policy applies: [apple.com/privacy](https://www.apple.com/privacy/)

## Data Sharing

We do **not**:
- Sell your data
- Share your data with third parties
- Use your data for advertising
- Track your behavior

## Required Reason APIs

In accordance with Apple's privacy requirements, the App declares usage of the following APIs in its privacy manifest:

| API Category | Reason | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| UserDefaults | CA92.1 | Saving game settings and preferences |
| System Boot Time | 35F9.1 | Measuring elapsed time for gesture detection |

## Children's Privacy

ParkVision does not collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13. It is suitable for all ages and complies with COPPA and similar regulations worldwide.

## Your Rights

Since we do not collect any personal data, there is no personal information to access, correct, or delete. You can:
- **Delete your data** by removing the app (local data) and disabling iCloud sync
- **Disable sync** by turning off iCloud for the app in Settings

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this policy. Any changes will be reflected by the "Last Updated" date above. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance.

